window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Become the hand of Fate. Cast the realm from darkness.</b></p> <p>A Guardian has staked his claim upon Mirror. Artos Null aims to take everything Zora has ever held dear, but mostly he wants what's inside her. The darkness. The void. The thing nuzzled against the back of her skull that pulses with power. It's a piece of him, and he wants it back, but Zora refuses to be his pet. She will never submit to his reign—even as Estal Kingdom burns, even as he chains her to a pit, even as the anchor bond between her and Cristen is stretched impossibly thin.</p> <p>But with the fate of her realm hanging in the balance, Zora must confront her own demons and make a choice that will change her realm forever.</p> <p>She must embrace the piece of darkness Artos so desperately wishes to claim from her, and she must do so with the eyes of the Gods watching.</p> <p><i>Brace yourself for the action-packed and thrilling conclusion of your favorite violent and irresistible fantasy romance. War, blood, and fate collide in this explosive final installment of the Fates of Mirror series.</i></p> <p><i>Immersive world-building, action-packed battles, and a love story that will leave you breathless, this fantasy romance is not for the faint-hearted. The threads of fate will unravel, the universe will be unveiled, and the stakes have never been higher. Get ready for an epic tale of love and its pitfalls, and—most importantly—prepare yourself for the end in this unforgettable finale to Zora Vyner's journey in the realm of Mirror. For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
